  "user_id": 1,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-cb9a05e6-5472-49e5-a815-b52656eb7b56",
        "text": "Now that we have the basic structure for our webpage, let's start adding actual content! Inside the `<body>` tags, we use different HTML elements to organize text.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a6582308cd930fdb25055ba5f83880b1-intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-panel-1-4e42169b-e61e-4402-8c79-64081ec434bc.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-63398054-b866-4a86-b1d3-5682df0a8a94",
        "text": "For major titles or important sections, we use heading tags. The most important heading, like the main title of your page, uses the `<h1>` tag.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ab3d18c76360edce311d0315831fdf02-intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-panel-2-9e10265b-3dda-457b-bd90-64edd0d8fb47.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-908ebeea-b760-4df2-a27b-921d1c2816fb",
        "text": "For regular text content, like sentences and paragraphs, we use the `<p>` tag. This helps group your sentences into readable blocks, just like in a book.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/be984d2dbb45b769cee99b6ac8117d2a-intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-panel-3-3da2887f-c19e-4d75-b48d-3817a1da6c2c.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-07879229-0bc1-4759-ae15-8db636142d01",
        "text": "All of this visible content — your headings and paragraphs — will be placed right inside the `<body>` tags. This builds the content that users will see on your webpage!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/779edfd7fbeafd58ee994dabc9954f19-intro-lesson-1-heading-and-paragraph-tags-panel-4-b8064aec-909d-4b9d-9b16-d244ae880ebb.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      }
    ],
    "generate_prompt": "Introduce common HTML text elements: the `<h1>` tag for main headings and the `<p>` tag for paragraphs. Explain how they are used to structure text content."
  },
